<title>CANADA: Canadian Gas Assoc storage survey - June 20.</title>
<headline>Canadian Gas Assoc storage survey - June 20.</headline>
<dateline>CALGARY 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Canadian Gas Association (CGA) weekly survey of Canadian natural gas in storage in billion cubic feet (bcf) for the week ended June 20:</p>
<p>							 Pct Full  Pct Full</p>
<p>		 06/20/97  06/13/97  Pct Full  Week Ago  Year Ago</p>
<p>East	     57.16     50.31     24.6	21.6	23.9</p>
<p>West	    100.55    103.82     39.2	40.1	45.2</p>
<p>Total Canada  157.70    154.13     32.2	31.4	35.5</p>
<p>East-West division is the Manitoba/Saskatchewan and North Dakota/Minnesota borders.</p>
<p>East capacity 06/20/97: 232.55 bcf, 06/13/97: 232.55 bcf.</p>
</text>
